{"module":"before-race","voice":"female","duration":465.3,"segments":[{"el":"title","text":"Before race: where the fear came from","start":0.0,"end":2.33,"words":[[0.05,0.36],[0.36,0.74],[1.01,1.24],[1.24,1.4],[1.4,1.63],[1.63,1.94],[1.94,2.24]]},{"el":"intro","text":"People often ask why the targeting of Black, Brown and Native people has lasted so long, and whether some forgotten origin explains it.","start":3.13,"end":11.53,"words":[[3.13,3.5],[3.5,3.79],[3.79,4.01],[4.01,4.22],[4.22,4.37],[4.37,4.88],[4.88,5.02],[5.02,5.39],[5.64,6.0],[6.0,6.22],[6.22,6.66],[6.66,7.02],[7.02,7.24],[7.24,7.67],[7.67,7.89],[7.89,8.18],[8.44,8.65],[8.65,8.94],[8.94,9.16],[9.16,9.67],[9.67,10.18],[10.18,10.83],[10.83,11.05]]},{"el":"intro","text":"The record gives a clearer answer: modern race is recent, it was written into law on purpose, and it has been defended by whatever argument was handy, including scripture and science.","start":11.88,"end":23.38,"words":[[11.93,12.07],[12.07,12.43],[12.43,12.72],[12.72,12.87],[12.87,13.3],[13.3,13.66],[13.91,14.28],[14.28,14.57],[14.57,14.71],[14.71,15.22],[15.47,15.61],[15.61,15.83],[15.83,16.19],[16.19,16.48],[16.48,16.63],[16.63,16.77],[16.77,17.2],[17.46,17.67],[17.67,17.82],[17.82,18.03],[18.03,18.25],[18.25,18.83],[18.83,19.05],[19.05,19.48],[19.48,20.06],[20.06,20.27],[20.27,20.71],[20.96,21.54],[21.54,22.12],[22.12,22.33],[22.33,22.84]]},{"el":"h0","text":"The ancient world sorted people differently","start":23.73,"end":26.66,"words":[[23.78,23.96],[23.96,24.57],[24.57,24.91],[24.91,25.35],[25.35,25.78],[25.78,26.57]]},{"el":"s0","text":"Slavery is ancient, but for most of history it was not based on skin color.","start":27.36,"end":32.46,"words":[[27.38,27.94],[27.94,28.09],[28.09,28.65],[28.9,29.11],[29.11,29.25],[29.25,29.6],[29.6,29.74],[29.74,30.24],[30.24,30.38],[30.38,30.59],[30.59,30.8],[30.8,31.16],[31.16,31.3],[31.3,31.58],[31.58,31.93]]},{"el":"s0","text":"Greeks, Romans, Egyptians, Africans, Arabs and Europeans enslaved people taken in war, sold for debt, or born to enslaved mothers, and enslaved people came from every region.","start":32.81,"end":45.77,"words":[[32.86,33.3],[33.57,34.17],[34.43,35.18],[35.44,36.11],[36.38,36.75],[36.75,36.98],[36.98,37.72],[37.72,38.32],[38.32,38.7],[38.7,39.15],[39.15,39.3],[39.3,39.52],[39.78,40.16],[40.16,40.31],[40.31,40.61],[40.87,40.95],[40.95,41.17],[41.17,41.32],[41.32,41.92],[41.92,42.37],[42.63,42.86],[42.86,43.45],[43.45,43.83],[43.83,44.13],[44.13,44.43],[44.43,44.73],[44.73,45.25]]},{"el":"s0","text":"The English word slave itself comes from Slav, because so many Eastern Europeans were enslaved in the Middle Ages.","start":46.12,"end":53.3,"words":[[46.17,46.32],[46.32,46.75],[46.75,46.97],[46.97,47.33],[47.33,47.76],[47.76,48.05],[48.05,48.34],[48.34,48.7],[48.95,49.31],[49.31,49.52],[49.52,49.81],[49.81,50.17],[50.17,50.89],[50.89,51.04],[51.04,51.61],[51.61,51.76],[51.76,51.9],[51.9,52.26],[52.26,52.77]]},{"el":"s0","text":"Historian Frank Snowden showed that Greek and Roman writers described Africans with curiosity and sometimes admiration, without the idea of a fixed racial ranking.","start":53.65,"end":64.6,"words":[[53.69,54.36],[54.36,54.74],[54.74,55.26],[55.26,55.56],[55.56,55.78],[55.78,56.08],[56.08,56.31],[56.31,56.75],[56.75,57.2],[57.2,57.88],[57.88,58.47],[58.47,58.7],[58.7,59.6],[59.6,59.82],[59.82,60.42],[60.42,61.24],[61.5,61.95],[61.95,62.1],[62.1,62.48],[62.48,62.62],[62.62,62.77],[62.77,63.15],[63.15,63.6],[63.6,64.12]]},{"el":"h1","text":"Race was written into law (1452–1705)","start":65.5,"end":69.69,"words":[[65.55,65.87],[65.87,66.12],[66.12,66.53],[66.53,66.86],[66.86,67.02],[67.02,69.31]]},{"el":"s1","text":"The idea that some people are naturally meant to be owned was spelled out step by step:","start":70.39,"end":75.39,"words":[[70.44,70.58],[70.58,70.94],[70.94,71.16],[71.16,71.37],[71.37,71.73],[71.73,71.8],[71.8,72.45],[72.45,72.73],[72.73,72.88],[72.88,73.02],[73.02,73.31],[73.31,73.52],[73.52,73.88],[73.88,74.1],[74.1,74.38],[74.38,74.6],[74.6,74.96]]},{"el":"s1","text":"1452–1455: Pope Nicholas V's bulls Dum Diversas and Romanus Pontifex authorized Portugal's king to conquer “Saracens and pagans” and reduce them to perpetual slavery.","start":75.74,"end":89.67,"words":[[75.78,78.22],[78.51,78.85],[78.85,79.44],[79.44,79.69],[79.69,80.02],[80.02,80.28],[80.28,80.95],[80.95,81.2],[81.2,81.87],[81.87,82.71],[82.71,83.38],[83.38,84.14],[84.14,84.39],[84.39,84.56],[84.56,84.98],[84.98,85.65],[85.65,85.9],[85.9,86.49],[86.49,86.74],[86.74,87.25],[87.25,87.5],[87.5,87.67],[87.67,88.42],[88.42,89.18]]},{"el":"s1","text":"Portugal's African slave trade grew under them.","start":90.02,"end":93.1,"words":[[90.07,90.69],[90.69,91.18],[91.18,91.52],[91.52,91.87],[91.87,92.07],[92.07,92.35],[92.35,92.62]]},{"el":"s1","text":"1493: Inter caetera gave Spain lands “discovered” in the Americas.","start":93.45,"end":98.36,"words":[[93.46,94.49],[94.74,95.01],[95.01,95.42],[95.42,95.7],[95.7,96.04],[96.04,96.39],[96.39,96.94],[96.94,97.08],[97.08,97.22],[97.22,97.84]]},{"el":"s1","text":"These bulls became the Doctrine of Discovery, which the U.S. Supreme Court adopted in Johnson v. M'Intosh (1823) to deny Native nations full ownership of their land.","start":98.71,"end":109.89,"words":[[98.76,98.97],[98.97,99.26],[99.26,99.68],[99.68,99.82],[99.82,100.32],[100.32,100.46],[100.46,101.17],[101.41,101.7],[101.7,101.84],[101.84,102.19],[102.55,102.97],[102.97,103.18],[103.18,103.68],[103.68,103.82],[103.82,104.31],[104.31,104.53],[104.88,105.38],[105.38,106.37],[106.61,106.75],[106.75,107.11],[107.11,107.53],[107.53,108.03],[108.03,108.24],[108.24,108.74],[108.74,108.88],[108.88,109.09],[109.09,109.44]]},{"el":"s1","text":"The Vatican repudiated the doctrine in 2023.","start":110.24,"end":113.75,"words":[[110.29,110.42],[110.42,110.85],[110.85,111.65],[111.65,111.77],[111.77,112.21],[112.21,112.33],[112.33,113.32]]},{"el":"s1","text":"The Supreme Court has not.","start":114.1,"end":115.89,"words":[[114.15,114.29],[114.29,114.71],[114.71,114.93],[114.93,115.14],[115.14,115.42]]},{"el":"s1","text":"1662: Virginia ruled that a child follows the condition of the mother, so children of enslaved women, including children of their enslavers, were born enslaved.","start":116.24,"end":126.63,"words":[[116.3,117.36],[117.59,118.12],[118.12,118.38],[118.38,118.58],[118.58,118.71],[118.71,119.11],[119.11,119.51],[119.51,119.64],[119.64,120.17],[120.17,120.3],[120.3,120.43],[120.43,120.76],[120.99,121.19],[121.19,121.72],[121.72,121.85],[121.85,122.38],[122.38,122.78],[123.01,123.54],[123.54,124.07],[124.07,124.2],[124.2,124.4],[124.4,125.06],[125.3,125.43],[125.43,125.63],[125.63,126.22]]},{"el":"s1","text":"1667–1705: Virginia declared that baptism does not free a slave (1667), that killing an enslaved person during “correction” was not a felony (1669), banned interracial marriage (1691), and gathered everything into the 1705 slave codes.","start":126.98,"end":148.61,"words":[[127.04,129.83],[130.11,130.75],[130.75,131.31],[131.31,131.55],[131.55,132.19],[132.19,132.43],[132.43,132.67],[132.67,132.91],[132.91,133.07],[133.07,133.47],[133.47,134.98],[135.26,135.5],[135.5,135.9],[135.9,136.06],[136.06,136.7],[136.7,137.1],[137.1,137.66],[137.66,138.3],[138.3,138.54],[138.54,138.78],[138.78,138.94],[138.94,139.41],[139.41,140.85],[141.13,141.45],[141.45,142.25],[142.25,142.73],[142.73,144.09],[144.37,144.61],[144.61,145.0],[145.0,145.56],[145.56,145.88],[145.88,146.04],[146.04,147.16],[147.16,147.56],[147.56,148.04]]},{"el":"s1","text":"France's Code Noir (1685) did the same for its colonies.","start":148.96,"end":153.51,"words":[[148.99,149.5],[149.5,149.8],[149.8,150.02],[150.02,151.12],[151.38,151.6],[151.6,151.75],[151.75,152.04],[152.04,152.19],[152.19,152.41],[152.41,153.0]]},{"el":"h2","text":"Dividing people who might unite","start":154.41,"end":156.56,"words":[[154.46,155.08],[155.08,155.46],[155.46,155.62],[155.62,155.93],[155.93,156.39]]},{"el":"s2","text":"In 1676, Bacon's Rebellion brought white indentured servants and enslaved Africans together in an armed revolt against Virginia's government.","start":157.26,"end":166.47,"words":[[157.31,157.44],[157.44,158.74],[158.98,159.45],[159.45,160.0],[160.0,160.27],[160.27,160.54],[160.54,161.16],[161.16,161.63],[161.63,161.84],[161.84,162.38],[162.38,162.93],[162.93,163.34],[163.34,163.47],[163.47,163.61],[163.61,163.81],[163.81,164.29],[164.29,164.7],[164.7,165.31],[165.31,165.99]]},{"el":"s2","text":"In the decades that followed, Virginia's laws gave poor white people small privileges (freedom dues, the right to bear arms, the right to strike a Black person) while taking rights away from all Black people, free or enslaved.","start":166.82,"end":181.24,"words":[[166.87,167.03],[167.03,167.18],[167.18,167.72],[167.72,167.95],[167.95,168.49],[168.76,169.45],[169.45,169.68],[169.68,169.99],[169.99,170.22],[170.22,170.53],[170.53,170.91],[170.91,171.22],[171.22,172.07],[172.07,172.53],[172.53,172.92],[173.19,173.34],[173.34,173.65],[173.65,173.8],[173.8,174.03],[174.03,174.34],[174.61,174.76],[174.76,175.07],[175.07,175.22],[175.22,175.69],[175.69,175.84],[175.84,176.15],[176.15,176.53],[176.8,177.11],[177.11,177.57],[177.57,177.96],[177.96,178.27],[178.27,178.57],[178.57,178.73],[178.73,179.03],[179.03,179.5],[179.77,180.0],[180.0,180.07],[180.07,180.77]]},{"el":"s2","text":"That the laws changed is documented.","start":181.59,"end":183.97,"words":[[181.63,181.82],[181.82,181.95],[181.95,182.14],[182.14,182.64],[182.64,182.77],[182.77,183.52]]},{"el":"s2","text":"Historian Edmund Morgan argued that the elite used race on purpose to keep poor white and Black people from uniting again.","start":184.32,"end":190.99,"words":[[184.36,184.98],[184.98,185.39],[185.39,185.74],[185.74,186.08],[186.08,186.28],[186.28,186.42],[186.42,186.7],[186.7,186.97],[186.97,187.24],[187.24,187.38],[187.38,187.72],[187.72,187.86],[187.86,188.07],[188.07,188.27],[188.27,188.55],[188.55,188.75],[188.75,189.03],[189.03,189.37],[189.37,189.64],[189.64,190.19],[190.19,190.54]]},{"el":"s2","text":"Others think the shift had more to do with the falling cost of enslaved Africans compared with English servants.","start":191.34,"end":197.43,"words":[[191.39,191.67],[191.67,191.95],[191.95,192.09],[192.09,192.37],[192.37,192.58],[192.58,192.72],[192.72,192.86],[192.86,193.0],[193.0,193.21],[193.21,193.35],[193.35,193.7],[193.7,193.98],[193.98,194.12],[194.12,194.68],[194.68,195.24],[195.24,195.73],[195.73,195.94],[195.94,196.36],[196.36,196.92]]},{"el":"s2","text":"Most agree the effect was the same.","start":197.78,"end":199.99,"words":[[197.83,198.16],[198.16,198.42],[198.42,198.55],[198.55,198.88],[198.88,199.07],[199.07,199.2],[199.2,199.53]]},{"el":"h3","text":"The practice came first, the ideas followed","start":200.89,"end":204.49,"words":[[200.93,201.12],[201.12,201.8],[201.8,202.18],[202.18,202.66],[203.0,203.19],[203.19,203.77],[203.77,204.35]]},{"el":"s3","text":"In 1944 the Trinidadian historian Eric Williams wrote that “slavery was not born of racism: rather, racism was the consequence of slavery.”","start":205.19,"end":215.03,"words":[[205.24,205.38],[205.38,206.31],[206.31,206.46],[206.46,207.31],[207.31,207.96],[207.96,208.25],[208.25,208.75],[208.75,209.03],[209.03,209.25],[209.25,209.82],[209.82,210.04],[210.04,210.25],[210.25,210.47],[210.47,210.61],[210.61,211.25],[211.5,211.86],[212.11,212.69],[212.69,212.9],[212.9,213.04],[213.04,213.76],[213.76,213.9],[213.9,214.55]]},{"el":"s3","text":"Ibram X. Kendi's Stamped from the Beginning (2016) traces the same pattern over five centuries: racist ideas were developed to defend policies that were already profitable.","start":215.38,"end":227.0,"words":[[215.44,215.8],[215.8,216.09],[216.44,216.87],[216.87,217.3],[217.3,217.59],[217.59,217.73],[217.73,218.23],[218.23,219.16],[219.41,219.91],[219.91,220.06],[220.06,220.34],[220.34,220.7],[220.7,220.99],[220.99,221.27],[221.27,221.99],[222.24,222.74],[222.74,223.17],[223.17,223.31],[223.31,223.88],[223.88,224.03],[224.03,224.46],[224.46,224.96],[224.96,225.17],[225.17,225.31],[225.31,225.74],[225.74,226.53]]},{"el":"s3","text":"Thomas Jefferson, who enslaved more than 600 people over his life, offered Black inferiority “as a suspicion only” in his Notes on the State of Virginia (1785).","start":227.35,"end":238.85,"words":[[227.35,227.73],[227.73,228.39],[228.65,228.8],[228.8,229.4],[229.4,229.54],[229.54,229.77],[229.77,230.58],[230.58,230.95],[230.95,231.25],[231.25,231.47],[231.47,231.84],[232.1,232.4],[232.4,232.7],[232.7,233.66],[233.66,233.81],[233.81,233.96],[233.96,234.55],[234.55,234.92],[234.92,235.07],[235.07,235.3],[235.3,235.67],[235.67,235.81],[235.81,235.96],[235.96,236.33],[236.33,236.48],[236.48,237.08],[237.08,238.34]]},{"el":"s3","text":"Within decades, “scientists” were measuring skulls to prove it (see the module on science).","start":239.2,"end":244.56,"words":[[239.25,239.6],[239.6,240.16],[240.41,241.12],[241.12,241.26],[241.26,241.75],[241.75,242.1],[242.1,242.24],[242.24,242.53],[242.53,242.67],[242.67,242.81],[242.81,242.95],[242.95,243.37],[243.37,243.51],[243.51,244.0]]},{"el":"h4","text":"What the fear was really about","start":245.46,"end":247.42,"words":[[245.51,245.76],[245.76,245.92],[245.92,246.17],[246.17,246.41],[246.41,246.82],[246.82,247.23]]},{"el":"s4","text":"The fear was real.","start":248.12,"end":249.59,"words":[[248.17,248.32],[248.32,248.53],[248.53,248.74],[248.74,249.1]]},{"el":"s4","text":"It was fear of revolt, of revenge, and of losing power at the ballot box:","start":249.94,"end":255.21,"words":[[249.98,250.13],[250.13,250.36],[250.36,250.59],[250.59,250.74],[250.74,251.35],[251.62,251.77],[251.77,252.38],[252.65,252.87],[252.87,253.03],[253.03,253.41],[253.41,253.71],[253.71,253.86],[253.86,254.02],[254.02,254.4],[254.4,254.78]]},{"el":"s4","text":"Haiti, 1791–1804: enslaved people overthrew French rule and founded the first free Black republic.","start":255.56,"end":264.05,"words":[[255.6,256.06],[256.33,258.55],[258.82,259.43],[259.43,259.82],[259.82,260.35],[260.35,260.81],[260.81,261.04],[261.04,261.27],[261.27,261.81],[261.81,261.96],[261.96,262.27],[262.27,262.5],[262.5,262.81],[262.81,263.5]]},{"el":"s4","text":"France later forced Haiti to pay 150 million francs (reduced to 90 million) for its own freedom, a debt Haiti paid off over about 120 years.","start":264.4,"end":274.57,"words":[[264.47,264.8],[264.8,265.13],[265.13,265.4],[265.4,265.73],[265.73,265.87],[265.87,266.07],[266.07,267.2],[267.2,267.6],[267.6,268.0],[268.0,268.47],[268.47,268.6],[268.6,269.0],[269.0,269.4],[269.63,269.77],[269.77,269.97],[269.97,270.17],[270.17,270.63],[270.87,271.0],[271.0,271.2],[271.2,271.53],[271.53,271.8],[271.8,271.93],[271.93,272.2],[272.2,272.54],[272.54,273.74],[273.74,274.07]]},{"el":"s4","text":"Nat Turner's rebellion, 1831: afterward, Virginia and other states tightened bans on teaching Black people to read and on Black preachers and gatherings.","start":274.92,"end":285.91,"words":[[274.98,275.22],[275.22,275.62],[275.62,276.33],[276.61,277.65],[277.93,278.57],[278.85,279.49],[279.49,279.73],[279.73,279.97],[279.97,280.45],[280.45,281.01],[281.01,281.33],[281.33,281.49],[281.49,281.97],[281.97,282.29],[282.29,282.69],[282.69,282.85],[282.85,283.09],[283.09,283.33],[283.33,283.49],[283.49,283.81],[283.81,284.37],[284.37,284.61],[284.61,285.33]]},{"el":"s4","text":"Reconstruction, 1867–1877: Black men voted and held office, and South Carolina's lower house had a Black majority.","start":286.26,"end":296.6,"words":[[286.31,287.37],[287.64,290.37],[290.64,290.94],[290.94,291.17],[291.17,291.62],[291.62,291.85],[291.85,292.15],[292.15,292.53],[292.8,293.03],[293.03,293.33],[293.33,294.09],[294.09,294.39],[294.39,294.7],[294.7,294.92],[294.92,295.08],[295.08,295.38],[295.38,296.14]]},{"el":"s4","text":"White-supremacist violence ended it, including the 1898 coup in Wilmington, North Carolina, where an elected biracial government was overthrown by force.","start":296.95,"end":307.88,"words":[[297.01,298.1],[298.1,298.68],[298.68,299.04],[299.04,299.26],[299.51,300.09],[300.09,300.23],[300.23,301.32],[301.32,301.53],[301.53,301.68],[301.68,302.4],[302.65,302.87],[302.87,303.59],[303.85,304.06],[304.06,304.21],[304.21,304.71],[304.71,305.36],[305.36,306.02],[306.02,306.23],[306.23,306.88],[306.88,307.1],[307.1,307.39]]},{"el":"s4","text":"“Replacement”: Madison Grant's The Passing of the Great Race (1916) warned that white Americans were being outbred.","start":308.23,"end":315.35,"words":[[308.27,309.06],[309.29,309.75],[309.75,310.14],[310.14,310.27],[310.27,310.6],[310.6,310.73],[310.73,310.86],[310.86,311.19],[311.19,311.45],[311.45,312.37],[312.6,312.86],[312.86,313.06],[313.06,313.32],[313.32,313.91],[313.91,314.04],[314.04,314.37],[314.37,314.9]]},{"el":"s4","text":"It helped pass the 1924 immigration quotas.","start":315.7,"end":319.44,"words":[[315.76,315.9],[315.9,316.25],[316.25,316.46],[316.46,316.6],[316.6,317.65],[317.65,318.35],[318.35,318.91]]},{"el":"s4","text":"The same fear, renamed the “Great Replacement,” was cited by the killers in El Paso (2019) and Buffalo (2022).","start":319.79,"end":328.07,"words":[[319.83,319.98],[319.98,320.26],[320.26,320.55],[320.8,321.3],[321.3,321.44],[321.44,321.8],[321.8,322.66],[322.66,322.87],[322.87,323.3],[323.3,323.51],[323.51,323.66],[323.66,324.01],[324.01,324.16],[324.16,324.3],[324.3,324.66],[324.66,325.58],[325.83,326.05],[326.05,326.55],[326.55,327.62]]},{"el":"h5","text":"How scripture was used, and misused","start":328.97,"end":331.84,"words":[[329.0,329.26],[329.26,329.93],[329.93,330.19],[330.19,330.61],[330.9,331.16],[331.16,331.75]]},{"el":"s5","text":"The “Curse of Ham.”","start":332.54,"end":333.69,"words":[[332.59,332.71],[332.71,332.9],[332.9,333.02],[333.02,333.26]]},{"el":"s5","text":"In Genesis 9:20–27, Noah curses Canaan, Ham's son, to be a servant.","start":334.04,"end":339.97,"words":[[334.09,334.23],[334.23,334.76],[334.76,336.36],[336.6,336.87],[336.87,337.2],[337.2,337.6],[337.84,338.1],[338.1,338.37],[338.6,338.74],[338.74,338.87],[338.87,339.01],[339.01,339.47]]},{"el":"s5","text":"The text says nothing about skin color or Africa.","start":340.32,"end":343.09,"words":[[340.37,340.5],[340.5,340.81],[340.81,340.99],[340.99,341.3],[341.3,341.61],[341.61,341.86],[341.86,342.1],[342.1,342.17],[342.17,342.6]]},{"el":"s5","text":"Linking the curse to dark skin came much later and was spread by interpreters across several traditions.","start":343.44,"end":349.25,"words":[[343.49,343.89],[343.89,344.03],[344.03,344.23],[344.23,344.36],[344.36,344.56],[344.56,344.83],[344.83,345.1],[345.1,345.37],[345.37,345.71],[345.71,345.91],[345.91,346.11],[346.11,346.45],[346.45,346.65],[346.65,347.32],[347.32,347.66],[347.66,348.06],[348.06,348.74]]},{"el":"s5","text":"By the 1800s it was a standard pro-slavery argument in American pulpits.","start":349.6,"end":354.91,"words":[[349.65,349.86],[349.86,349.99],[349.99,350.87],[350.87,351.01],[351.01,351.21],[351.21,351.35],[351.35,351.82],[351.82,352.63],[352.63,353.18],[353.18,353.31],[353.31,353.85],[353.85,354.39]]},{"el":"s5","text":"The “Slave Bible.”","start":355.26,"end":356.64,"words":[[355.3,355.43],[355.43,355.74],[355.74,356.19]]},{"el":"s5","text":"In 1807 a British missionary society printed Select Parts of the Holy Bible, for the Use of the Negro Slaves.","start":356.99,"end":365.43,"words":[[357.04,357.2],[357.2,358.16],[358.16,358.32],[358.32,358.8],[358.8,359.43],[359.43,360.07],[360.07,360.63],[360.63,361.11],[361.11,361.43],[361.43,361.59],[361.59,361.74],[361.74,362.14],[362.14,362.7],[362.98,363.14],[363.14,363.3],[363.3,363.54],[363.54,363.7],[363.7,363.86],[363.86,364.34],[364.34,364.89]]},{"el":"s5","text":"It cut most of the Old Testament, including the Exodus story of freedom from slavery, and kept passages like “Servants, be obedient to them that are your masters.”","start":365.78,"end":376.8,"words":[[365.83,365.98],[365.98,366.21],[366.21,366.59],[366.59,366.74],[366.74,366.89],[366.89,367.19],[367.19,367.95],[368.21,368.81],[368.81,368.96],[368.96,369.49],[369.49,369.87],[369.87,370.02],[370.02,370.47],[370.47,370.78],[370.78,371.45],[371.72,371.95],[371.95,372.25],[372.25,372.85],[372.85,373.15],[373.15,373.76],[374.02,374.17],[374.17,374.85],[374.85,375.0],[375.0,375.23],[375.23,375.46],[375.46,375.53],[375.53,375.68],[375.68,376.21]]},{"el":"s5","text":"Scripture was also the strongest weapon against slavery: enslaved people sang of Moses and Exodus, and abolitionists from Frederick Douglass to the Black church built their case on it.","start":377.15,"end":388.12,"words":[[377.17,377.72],[377.72,377.93],[377.93,378.28],[378.28,378.42],[378.42,379.04],[379.04,379.38],[379.38,379.8],[379.8,380.42],[380.66,381.22],[381.22,381.56],[381.56,381.77],[381.77,381.91],[381.91,382.33],[382.33,382.53],[382.53,383.09],[383.33,383.54],[383.54,384.37],[384.37,384.64],[384.64,385.2],[385.2,385.61],[385.61,385.75],[385.75,385.89],[385.89,386.17],[386.17,386.51],[386.51,386.79],[386.79,387.0],[387.0,387.27],[387.27,387.41],[387.41,387.62]]},{"el":"h6","text":"The Book of Enoch and modern race myths","start":389.02,"end":391.53,"words":[[389.07,389.24],[389.24,389.5],[389.5,389.67],[389.67,390.01],[390.01,390.27],[390.27,390.69],[390.69,391.03],[391.03,391.38]]},{"el":"s6","text":"1 Enoch is an ancient Jewish book that is part of the Bible of the Ethiopian Orthodox Church; fragments were found among the Dead Sea Scrolls, and the Letter of Jude (verses 14–15) quotes it.","start":392.23,"end":404.86,"words":[[392.29,392.52],[392.52,392.82],[392.82,392.97],[392.97,393.13],[393.13,393.66],[393.66,394.04],[394.04,394.27],[394.27,394.5],[394.5,394.65],[394.65,394.88],[394.88,395.03],[395.03,395.18],[395.18,395.64],[395.64,395.79],[395.79,395.94],[395.94,396.7],[396.7,397.24],[397.24,397.69],[397.96,398.64],[398.64,398.8],[398.8,399.18],[399.18,399.48],[399.48,399.63],[399.63,399.86],[399.86,400.01],[400.01,400.62],[400.89,401.12],[401.12,401.27],[401.27,401.57],[401.57,401.72],[401.72,402.03],[402.03,402.41],[402.41,403.4],[403.67,404.12],[404.12,404.35]]},{"el":"s6","text":"It tells how angels called the Watchers came to earth, taught forbidden knowledge, and fathered giants (the Nephilim of Genesis 6).","start":405.21,"end":413.59,"words":[[405.26,405.41],[405.41,405.72],[405.72,405.95],[405.95,406.56],[406.56,406.87],[406.87,407.02],[407.02,407.48],[407.48,407.79],[407.79,407.94],[407.94,408.17],[408.44,408.67],[408.67,409.2],[409.2,409.74],[410.01,410.24],[410.24,410.62],[410.62,411.23],[411.23,411.38],[411.38,411.92],[411.92,412.07],[412.07,412.69],[412.69,413.07]]},{"el":"s6","text":"It contains no teaching about race.","start":413.94,"end":416.28,"words":[[413.99,414.12],[414.12,414.63],[414.63,414.82],[414.82,415.21],[415.21,415.53],[415.53,415.85]]},{"el":"s6","text":"Modern movements have still built race stories on Genesis and Enoch.","start":416.63,"end":421.03,"words":[[416.68,417.05],[417.05,417.65],[417.65,417.87],[417.87,418.17],[418.17,418.47],[418.47,418.77],[418.77,419.22],[419.22,419.37],[419.37,419.97],[419.97,420.19],[420.19,420.56]]},{"el":"s6","text":"We describe them so you can recognize them, not because they are true:","start":421.38,"end":425.45,"words":[[421.44,421.57],[421.57,422.12],[422.12,422.32],[422.32,422.52],[422.52,422.66],[422.66,422.86],[422.86,423.47],[423.47,423.75],[423.98,424.19],[424.19,424.53],[424.53,424.73],[424.73,424.8],[424.8,425.07]]},{"el":"s6","text":"Christian Identity “two-seedline” theology, a white-supremacist doctrine claiming Jews and people of color descend from the serpent or from “pre-Adamic” races.","start":425.8,"end":435.8,"words":[[425.85,426.44],[426.44,427.09],[427.09,427.75],[427.75,428.48],[428.74,428.89],[428.89,429.98],[429.98,430.49],[430.49,431.0],[431.0,431.3],[431.3,431.52],[431.52,431.88],[431.88,432.03],[432.03,432.32],[432.32,432.76],[432.76,433.05],[433.05,433.2],[433.2,433.64],[433.64,433.71],[433.71,434.0],[434.0,434.73],[434.73,435.24]]},{"el":"s6","text":"The Nation of Islam's story of Yakub, which teaches that a scientist named Yakub created white people thousands of years ago.","start":436.15,"end":443.61,"words":[[436.2,436.33],[436.33,436.74],[436.74,436.87],[436.87,437.27],[437.27,437.61],[437.61,437.74],[437.74,438.14],[438.38,438.65],[438.65,439.05],[439.05,439.25],[439.25,439.39],[439.39,439.99],[439.99,440.33],[440.33,440.66],[440.66,441.27],[441.27,441.53],[441.53,441.87],[441.87,442.41],[442.41,442.54],[442.54,442.81],[442.81,443.15]]},{"el":"s6","text":"Some Hebrew Israelite groups teach that Black, Hispanic and Native Americans are the true Israelites and that others are cursed.","start":443.96,"end":452.19,"words":[[444.01,444.25],[444.25,444.65],[444.65,445.38],[445.38,445.78],[445.78,446.1],[446.1,446.34],[446.34,446.74],[447.02,447.66],[447.66,447.9],[447.9,448.38],[448.38,449.11],[449.11,449.19],[449.19,449.35],[449.35,449.59],[449.59,450.39],[450.39,450.63],[450.63,450.87],[450.87,451.19],[451.19,451.27],[451.27,451.67]]},{"el":"s6","text":"These stories mirror each other: each claims race is ancient, fixed and cosmic.","start":452.54,"end":457.53,"words":[[452.6,452.81],[452.81,453.22],[453.22,453.5],[453.5,453.7],[453.7,453.98],[454.22,454.42],[454.42,454.83],[454.83,455.11],[455.11,455.24],[455.24,455.79],[456.03,456.38],[456.38,456.58],[456.58,457.06]]},{"el":"s6","text":"The historical record shows the opposite: race is recent, made by people, and can be unmade.","start":457.88,"end":464.41,"words":[[457.92,458.06],[458.06,458.8],[458.8,459.17],[459.17,459.47],[459.47,459.62],[459.62,460.14],[460.4,460.69],[460.69,460.84],[460.84,461.36],[461.62,461.91],[461.91,462.14],[462.14,462.58],[462.84,463.06],[463.06,463.28],[463.28,463.43],[463.43,463.95]]}]}